{"n": 121, "w": 1000, "h": 764, "img": "121.webp", "text": "11-101\n\n11 00 039 CHECKING COMPRESSION\nOF ALL CYLINDERS\n\nUnscrew trim panel and pull off master\nrelay (2).\n\nUnscrew nuts (1) on ignition lead pipe\nand pull off spark plug cannectors.\n\nUnscrew spark plugs with Special Tool\n121 160.\n\nInstallation\n\nTightening torque: 20 Nm (14.5 ft. Ibs.).\n\nScrew In testing adapter, Special Tool\n11 0 165, and connect compression\ntester.\n\nPress down on accelerator pedal and\nOperate starter until the compression\nstops rising.\n\nThe value of all cylinders should not\ndeviate by more than 0.5 bar (7 psi).\nSpecification: 10 to 11 bar (142 to 156\npsi).", "words": [["11-101", 0.465, 0.0398, 0.5294, 0.0623], ["11", 0.272, 0.0836, 0.2812, 0.0928], ["00", 0.2872, 0.0829, 0.2989, 0.0935], ["039", 0.3029, 0.0822, 0.3217, 0.0935], ["CHECKING", 0.3293, 0.0816, 0.388, 0.0935], ["COMPRESSION", 0.3926, 0.0816, 0.4752, 0.0935], ["OF", 0.3293, 0.0988, 0.345, 0.1101], ["ALL", 0.349, 0.0995, 0.3698, 0.1101], ["CYLINDERS", 0.3744, 0.0981, 0.4382, 0.1101], ["Unscrew", 0.2715, 0.1326, 0.3181, 0.1432], ["trim", 0.3222, 0.1326, 0.3425, 0.1432], ["panel", 0.3465, 0.1326, 0.3749, 0.1459], ["and", 0.3794, 0.1326, 0.3987, 0.1432], ["pull", 0.4032, 0.132, 0.4215, 0.1459], ["off", 0.426, 0.132, 0.4397, 0.1432], ["master", 0.4438, 0.1326, 0.4802, 0.1426], ["relay", 0.2715, 0.1499, 0.2974, 0.1631], ["(2).", 0.3009, 0.1492, 0.3176, 0.1618], ["Unscrew", 0.2725, 0.317, 0.3186, 0.3276], ["nuts", 0.3232, 0.3176, 0.346, 0.3276], ["(1)", 0.3495, 0.317, 0.3632, 0.3296], ["on", 0.3668, 0.3183, 0.3804, 0.3276], ["ignition", 0.3845, 0.3163, 0.4245, 0.3302], ["lead", 0.4286, 0.3163, 0.4498, 0.3269], ["pipe", 0.4544, 0.3163, 0.4767, 0.3289], ["and", 0.272, 0.3336, 0.2918, 0.3442], ["pull", 0.2953, 0.3329, 0.3151, 0.3468], ["off", 0.3191, 0.3329, 0.3333, 0.3442], ["spark", 0.3374, 0.3329, 0.3663, 0.3468], ["plug", 0.3708, 0.3329, 0.3936, 0.3468], ["cannectors.", 0.3977, 0.3336, 0.4605, 0.3442], ["